NAME
    copy - Copy a file. If destination names a directory, the source leaf name is appended. An existing destination file is overwritten.

SYNOPSIS
    copy <source> <destination>

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    Copy a file. If destination names a directory, the source leaf name is appended. An existing destination file is overwritten.

FAT NAME SUPPORT
    The current Inu FAT provider creates and renames entries using FAT 8.3 short names.
    Long-file-name creation and rename are reserved for a later filesystem-provider extension.

EXAMPLES
    copy README.TXT BACKUP.TXT
    copy README.TXT \TEMP

FILES
    /System/Commands/COPY.CMD
    /INU/HELP/COPY.MAN
